  <item>
    <title>主角之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68921ee4638b0158791c8756</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68921ee4638b0158791c8756</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 15:19:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>想找离珠1v1的朋友请看看《</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/home?t=home/index&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;token=950819081" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/home?t=home/index&amp;lang=zh_CN&amp;token=950819081"><strong><span>离珠使用说明书</span></strong></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;很多人终其一生都是NPC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;把主角之路看成过程而不是结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">5:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>主角框架Part 1：要有强主体性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">6:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;反例1：亦舒的小聪明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;反例2：《欲望都市》Carrie的戏精做派</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>主角框架Part 2：找回主线任务</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;艺人其实是能量乞讨者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主线任务必须满足两个条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>主角框架Part 3：形成对集体暗示的抗阻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;粉转黑其实是换一种方式给爱豆赋能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;钟摆理论：你是否在“被集体收割”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;社会能量角色四象限模型：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第一象限｜高共情 × 高主体性：精神导师&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第二象限｜高共情 × 低主体性：吃瓜群众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第三象限｜低共情 × 低主体性：社会隐形人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第四象限｜低共情 × 高主体性：科技狂人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqqLdLu0_-clLl8yanmACDBCGXGu.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>尬聊主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>离珠∞，曾从事新闻工作，后来跑去写电影剧本，再后来开始研究命运剧本（</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTQwOTA0Mg==&amp;mid=2247485112&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a8bfedb3a42494a3eab382b4097b1892&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTQwOTA0Mg==&amp;mid=2247485112&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a8bfedb3a42494a3eab382b4097b1892&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>离珠两次无厘头跨界转型的故事</span></a><span>），会七政四余和奇门遁甲，致力于将玄学用于现代人生规划，已帮数百位客户认清天赋、突破卡点，2025年推出“</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTQwOTA0Mg==&amp;mid=2247484738&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=72b04f52cc9533b7f14611c34765e850&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTQwOTA0Mg==&amp;mid=2247484738&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=72b04f52cc9533b7f14611c34765e850&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>离图腾</span></a><span>”标准化分析框架，未来会继续在神秘学领域里玩耍和探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：天风姤呛</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>离珠老说的七政四余到底是什么东东？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>七政四余是中国最古老的占星术，这个系统以七颗政星（太阳，月亮，金星，木星，水星，火星，土星）和四颗余星（月孛、紫炁、罗睺、计都）作为观察对象，因此被叫做“七政四余”。它最早见于黄帝时代，不但包含中国传统命理学的阴阳五行、二十八星宿、神煞、天星化曜，还融合了印占的黄道十二宫概念，是八字、紫微斗数、风水学、文殊占卜法的源头，可精准推算一日之吉凶。</span></em></p>]]></description>
